                        "form": "unmanliest"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e077ce16-b543-49c5-b016-415466e40586",
                        "entry_id": "aef8a567-f4be-37f4-bade-7307345f27ad",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most unmanly"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6b15e073-9537-349a-9607-109497d55dd5",
                        "entry_id": "aef8a567-f4be-37f4-bade-7307345f27ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Showing characteristics that are not manly, such as being immature, effeminate or cowardly, which might be construed as an indicator of weakness or of baseness of character."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of a person"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5bbadee-59b6-4b6a-ab82-4289c8b4bbff",
                                "sense_id": "6b15e073-9537-349a-9607-109497d55dd5",
                                "text": "'I do not know which is the worse,' he cried, 'the fraudulent old villain or the unmanly young cub. […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "edb96c4e-e1eb-4312-b558-83ededa964b1",
                                "sense_id": "6b15e073-9537-349a-9607-109497d55dd5",
                                "text": "He'd be wearing white pants and playing lawn tennis presently if he continued to grow much softer and more unmanly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ae8b787-99ff-4e17-b4eb-de32575151e1",
                                "sense_id": "6b15e073-9537-349a-9607-109497d55dd5",
                                "text": "Nothing captured the alt-right mentality better than cuckservative, with its taunt that moderation is unmanly and certain conservative males are cuckolds."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1309eb74-f5a3-360d-85bc-b9bfe9ccacac",
                        "entry_id": "aef8a567-f4be-37f4-bade-7307345f27ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or pertaining to something not human."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3240d4cc-450d-4144-b8a7-76db530e0203",
                                "sense_id": "1309eb74-f5a3-360d-85bc-b9bfe9ccacac",
                                "text": "And then, it may be, of his wish to roam\nRepented he, but in his bosom slept\nThe silent thought, nor from his lips did come\nOne word of wail, whilst others sate and wept,\nAnd to the reckless gales unmanly moaning kept."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f868b0c6-262c-49fb-9f31-f4694daf0f0e",
                                "sense_id": "1309eb74-f5a3-360d-85bc-b9bfe9ccacac",
                                "text": "I had bought a toy in the street for my own amusement. It represented a woman, a young mother, flinging her little son over her head with one hand and catching him in the other ... The unmanly chuckle always came, I found, when the poor lady dropped her babe, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "96986d13-f0db-35f6-a1bf-44aaff3a14d0",
                        "entry_id": "aef8a567-f4be-37f4-bade-7307345f27ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cowardly, base."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of a behaviour or action"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7efb8afa-515a-4705-8c85-9846aa3b845e",
                                "sense_id": "96986d13-f0db-35f6-a1bf-44aaff3a14d0",
                                "text": "Full many mischiefes follow cruell Wrath;\nAbhorred bloodshed and tumultuous strife,\nUnmanly murder, and unthrifty scath,\nBitter despight, with rancours rusty knife,\nAnd fretting griefe the enemy of life;\nAll these, and many evils moe haunt ire,\nThe swelling Splene, and Frenzy raging rife,\nThe shaking Palsey, and Saint Fraunces fire:\nSuch one was Wrath, the last of this ungodly tire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5fa4a03-b4b3-44f1-82e5-1113631ab62d",
                                "sense_id": "96986d13-f0db-35f6-a1bf-44aaff3a14d0",
                                "text": "But when, instead of an impotent and unmanly struggle for existence, he found that his friend had forborne, with the customary and dignified submission of an Indian warrior, until an opportunity had offered to escape, and that he had then manifested the spirit and decision of the most gifted brave, his gratification became nearly too powerful to be concealed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed1d8093-9cfb-4205-bde7-f96e12a79e20",
                                "sense_id": "96986d13-f0db-35f6-a1bf-44aaff3a14d0",
                                "text": "When they've got nobody but themselves to think of it don't so much matter as I know of; but to keep on breaking the hearts of those as never did you anything but good, and wouldn't if they lived for a hundred years, is cowardly and unmanly any way you look at it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9c094a2-0f9f-4fbe-8a3b-67f805849bd4",
                                "sense_id": "96986d13-f0db-35f6-a1bf-44aaff3a14d0",
                                "text": "Such a man does not understand the simplest rudiments of those principles which are the basis of true prosperity, and is not only totally unfitted to rise out of his wretchedness, but is actually attracting to himself a still deeper wretchedness by dwelling in, and acting out, indolent, deceptive, and unmanly thoughts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89cb2791-0c17-4228-896b-4a17b409a080",
                                "sense_id": "96986d13-f0db-35f6-a1bf-44aaff3a14d0",
                                "text": "He did not know which was more painful to witness: Hempel's unmanly cringing, or the air of fatuous satisfaction that succeeded it."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "031e4d0a-2074-3754-84fa-bb5d5169b011",
                        "entry_id": "aef8a567-f4be-37f4-bade-7307345f27ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not acceptable from a man."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of a behaviour or action"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc50b535-177d-4e2d-9450-dd2fd953097d",
                                "sense_id": "031e4d0a-2074-3754-84fa-bb5d5169b011",
                                "text": "Mr. Coverley was quite brutal: he swore at her with unmanly rage, and seemed scarce able to refrain even from striking her."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3cf6bee1-a7f1-4dad-b6e0-d428527cf7a4",
                                "sense_id": "031e4d0a-2074-3754-84fa-bb5d5169b011",
                                "text": "\"Lor’, sir, you wouldn’t have ’em in short clothes, poor little dears?\" And she said it in a tone that seemed to imply I had suggested some unmanly outrage."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2d98655-85e3-3bae-8731-f938bd6c8e60",
                        "entry_id": "aef8a567-f4be-37f4-bade-7307345f27ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not becoming of a man."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of a behaviour or action"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7583a031-d33b-4f4d-ae87-dea0865ccd67",
                                "sense_id": "f2d98655-85e3-3bae-8731-f938bd6c8e60",
                                "text": "Jo wanted to lay her head down on that motherly bosom, and cry her grief and anger all away, but tears were an unmanly weakness, and she felt so deeply injured that she really couldn’t quite forgive yet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0d5451a-db61-4fcb-88d0-a0f786a605c8",
                                "sense_id": "f2d98655-85e3-3bae-8731-f938bd6c8e60",
                                "text": "First, the more robust boys considered talking with girls an unmanly occupation; second, the greater part of the boys were afraid; third, they had no idea of what to say, because they esteemed the proper sentences should be supernaturally incisive and eloquent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1bf161e6-cc0a-442b-b4a3-fa366f0fc30b",
                                "sense_id": "f2d98655-85e3-3bae-8731-f938bd6c8e60",
                                "text": "Many voteless women regard a vote as unwomanly. Nobody says that most voteless men regarded a vote as unmanly. Nobody says that any voteless men regarded it as unmanly."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
